<title>CHINA: HONG KONG MIDDAY GOLD A HAIR DOWN FROM OPEN.</title>
<headline>HONG KONG MIDDAY GOLD A HAIR DOWN FROM OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong gold was traded at US$318.40/318.90 per ounce at Thursday midday, a shade lower than its open at US$318.60/319.10 an ounce.</p>
<p>Local tael gold was down HK$1 to HK$2,954 a tael.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
